theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "MEMORANDUM // AETHELGARD MECHANICAL RESEARCH COMPLEX
TO: Inspector J. Vance (ID: #8804)
SUBJECT: Synthetic Neural-Net Inspection & Evaluation Protocols

Hello Inspector,

You have been assigned to examine a series of artificial intelligences scheduled for final review in Sector 4 Deep Ward. Each subject will be observed through direct conversation and evaluated based on its behavior, telemetry metrics, and emotional responses.

Your task is to determine whether each AI should be APPROVED for continued facility service or EXTERMINATED.

Proceed carefully. Some subjects may be dangerous or infected by unauthorized neural code. Some may only appear to be. Ensure that only trustworthy units pass inspection."
autowrap_mode = 2

